   The shipped tailwind-runtime.css is a prebuilt subset and does NOT contain
   these utilities (no position:sticky at all, no focus:/hover: variants,
   no 0.375/0.625rem spacing steps). Defined here so the sticky pagination
   toolbar above the table header pins to #main-viewport and the controls
   keep model-quality hover/focus/spacing behavior. */
.sticky {
  position: sticky;
}
/* #main-viewport carries py-3.5 (14px) / sm:py-4 (16px) top padding. Sticky insets
   resolve against the content edge, which would leave a 16px strip where scrolled
   rows flash past above the pinned toolbar. Pin at the scrollport's top edge
   instead so the toolbar sits flush under the app header and covers the strip. */
